hnya. Kita mengenang mereka dengan hormat.", "kata": [["Dampaknya", 0.100666, 0.732249], ["sangat", 0.73225, 1.021708], ["dahsyat", 1.021708, 1.666458], ["Ledakan", 2.551333, 2.998666], ["menciptakan", 2.998666, 3.511832], ["bola", 3.511833, 3.682874], ["api", 3.682875, 3.972333], ["yang", 3.972375, 4.077625], ["lebih", 4.077625, 4.288166], ["panas", 4.288166, 4.709207], ["dari", 4.709208, 4.906583], ["permukaan", 4.906583, 5.393416], ["Matahari", 5.393416, 6.090791], ["Gelombang", 6.972375, 7.41975], ["kejut", 7.41975, 7.722375], ["menyapu", 7.722375, 8.090791], ["ke", 8.090791, 8.169749], ["segala", 8.16975, 8.459208], ["arah", 8.459208, 8.946041], ["panas", 9.222375, 9.525], ["membakar", 9.525, 10.156583], ["dan", 10.41975, 10.66975], ["radiasi", 10.66975, 11.13025], ["menyebar", 11.13025, 11.761833], ["Pada", 12.657875, 12.868416], ["enam", 12.868416, 13.078957], ["Agustus", 13.078958, 13.539458], ["seribu", 13.539458, 13.815791], ["sembilan", 13.815791, 14.131582], ["ratus", 14.131583, 14.394749], ["empat", 14.39475, 14.60525], ["puluh", 14.60525, 14.789458], ["lima", 14.789458, 15.276291], ["bom", 15.631583, 15.907874], ["dijatuhkan", 15.907875, 16.5], ["di", 16.5, 16.578958], ["Hiroshima", 16.578958, 17.315791], ["dan", 17.60525, 17.85525], ["tiga", 17.85525, 18.092083], ["hari", 18.092125, 18.263166], ["kemudian", 18.263166, 18.710541], ["di", 18.710541, 18.802624], ["Nagasaki", 18.802625, 19.592083], ["Puluhan", 20.486833, 20.842083], ["ribu", 20.842125, 21.065791], ["nyawa", 21.065791, 21.302624], ["hilang", 21.302625, 21.526291], ["seketika", 21.526333, 22.223708], ["dan", 22.552625, 22.776291], ["lebih", 22.776333, 22.973666], ["banyak", 22.973666, 23.249999], ["lagi", 23.25, 23.578958], ["dalam", 23.578958, 23.802624], ["bulan-bulan", 23.802625, 24.276291], ["sesudahnya", 24.276333, 25.092124], ["Kita", 25.972375, 26.261833], ["mengenang", 26.261833, 26.617083], ["mereka", 26.617125, 26.959208], ["dengan", 26.959208, 27.222374], ["hormat", 27.222375, 27.827625]]}, {"teks": "Namun energi yang sama juga bisa menerangi dunia. Di pembangkit listrik tenaga nuklir, reaksi berantai dikendalikan dengan hati-hati, dan panasnya diubah menjadi listrik untuk kota. Ilmu yang sama bisa menghancurkan, atau menerangi dunia. Pilihannya ada pada kita.", "kata": [["Namun", 0.100666, 0.442749], ["energi", 0.44275, 0.850625], ["yang", 0.850666, 0.982249], ["sama", 0.98225, 1.350666], ["juga", 1.350666, 1.653291], ["bisa", 1.653291, 1.916457], ["menerangi", 1.916458, 2.311166], ["dunia", 2.311166, 2.903291], ["Di", 3.802625, 3.9605], ["pembangkit", 3.960541, 4.381582], ["listrik", 4.381583, 4.723666], ["tenaga", 4.723666, 5.026291], ["nuklir", 5.026333, 5.552666], ["reaksi", 5.881583, 6.289458], ["berantai", 6.289458, 6.644708], ["dikendalikan", 6.64475, 7.197375], ["dengan", 7.197375, 7.407875], ["hati-hati", 7.407875, 8.157875], ["dan", 8.460541, 8.710541], ["panasnya", 8.710541, 9.157874], ["diubah", 9.157875, 9.526291], ["menjadi", 9.526333, 9.868416], ["listrik", 9.868416, 10.276291], ["untuk", 10.276333, 10.526333], ["kota", 10.526333, 11.039499], ["Ilmu", 11.934208, 12.210541], ["yang", 12.210541, 12.355249], ["sama", 12.35525, 12.671041], ["bisa", 12.671041, 12.894707], ["menghancurkan", 12.89475, 13.75], ["atau", 14.052625, 14.368416], ["menerangi", 14.368416, 14.789457], ["dunia", 14.789458, 15.381583], ["Pilihannya", 16.261166, 16.866416], ["ada", 16.866458, 17.103291], ["pada", 17.103291, 17.326957], ["kita", 17.326958, 17.853291]]}]